# The answers the shell guard gives the everyday commands that
# `everyday_answers.templates` makes, one case to a line, in the order the
# templates make them. Written by `just everyday-record`, never by hand:
# `tests/everyday_answers.rs` fails when this is not what it writes
# (CONTRIBUTING.md, "The everyday answers").

